			"styles": "\n\t/* A comment at a combinator boundary */\n\t@supports selector(div /* c */ > span) {\n\t\tdiv {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t/* A comment inside a functional pseudo-class argument */\n\t@supports selector(:has(/* c */ .class)) {\n\t\tdiv {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t/* A comment in an argument that is not a selector */\n\t@supports selector(. /* c */) {\n\t\tdiv {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
